<c.yellow>el mundo estaba a saco dando caña</c>

00:47:52.206 --> 00:47:53.229 line:77%
<c.yellow>y tal,</c>

00:47:53.453 --> 00:47:54.861 line:75%
<c.yellow>le quiero agradecer a Rufián</c>
<c.yellow>que ha sido honesto</c>

00:47:55.493 --> 00:47:57.413 line:75%
<c.yellow>y nos ha defendido un poquito,</c>
